lay">Product description</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="relative rounded-8 mediaContainer-fk0Sf6"><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 max-h-[442px]" style="max-height:442px"><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:600;color:#000000">Shilucheng Bamboo Sheets </span><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000;font-style:italic">60% bamboo and 40% polyester fiber  </span><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">Deep pockets fit mattresses up to 16&quot;</span></div><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">Affordable Luxury</span></div><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">This set offers the pinnacle of modern luxury bedding at an affordable price. </span><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">14&quot; Deep Pocket with great elasticity, Stretches to Fit Mattresses Up to 16&quot; Thick.</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> The sheets grip and fit better than any other set, ensuring no sliding during sleep. Enjoy a restful night&#x27;s sleep with these sheets.</span></div><img class="descriptionImage-mNxo82 mb-8 rounded-12" src="https://p16-oec-general-useast8.ttcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2/f5727f32345d45a8bd7db4154df565d4~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:800:327.webp?dr=12185&amp;t=555f072d&amp;ps=933b5bde&amp;shp=c940a200&amp;shcp=9b759fb9&amp;idc=useast5&amp;from=3376456192" alt="Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set - 4/6 Pc Bedding Set with 16&#x27;&#x27; Deep Pocket Lightweight, Twill, Smooth Fitted Sheets, Cooling Breathable, Hotel Luxury Super Silky Soft, Wrinkle &amp; Fade Resistant" title="Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set - 4/6 Pc Bedding Set with 16&#x27;&#x27; Deep Pocket Lightweight, Twill, Smooth Fitted Sheets, Cooling Breathable, Hotel Luxury Super Silky Soft, Wrinkle &amp; Fade Resistant" loading="lazy" width="800" height="327" style="aspect-ratio:2.4464831804281344;max-width:max(0px, calc(244.6483vh - 391.4373px))"/><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">Shockingly Soft &amp; Silky</span></div><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000;font-style:italic">Made from 60% rayon derived from bamboo and 40% polyester fiber</span><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">,</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> with a unique twill weave. It&#x27;s stronger than cotton, smooth like silk, and cool to the touch. Sleep like you&#x27;re on a cloud. Ideal for hot sleepers, these sheets provide comfort and coolness.</span></div><img class="descriptionImage-mNxo82 mb-8 rounded-12" src="https://p16-oec-general-useast8.ttcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2/027b5b2b82d3477f9a7c335c8956f927~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:800:327.webp?dr=12185&amp;t=555f072d&amp;ps=933b5bde&amp;shp=c940a200&amp;shcp=9b759fb9&amp;idc=useast5&amp;from=3376456192" alt="Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set - 4/6 Pc Bedding Set with 16&#x27;&#x27; Deep Pocket Lightweight, Twill, Smooth Fitted Sheets, Cooling Breathable, Hotel Luxury Super Silky Soft, Wrinkle &amp; Fade Resistant" title="Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set - 4/6 Pc Bedding Set with 16&#x27;&#x27; Deep Pocket Lightweight, Twill, Smooth Fitted Sheets, Cooling Breathable, Hotel Luxury Super Silky Soft, Wrinkle &amp; Fade Resistant" loading="lazy" width="800" height="327" style="aspect-ratio:2.4464831804281344;max-width:max(0px, calc(244.6483vh - 391.4373px))"/><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">️ </span><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">Adjust Temperature &amp; Absorb Water</span><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000"> ️</span></div><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">The sheets adjust temperature and absorb most of the heat, keeping you cool in summer. They also absorb moisture, keeping you dry and eliminating bad sleep experiences for those with night sweats.</span></div><img class="descriptionImage-mNxo82 mb-8 rounded-12" src="https://p16-oec-general-useast8.ttcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2/986e87d5930f4126b6c71b913c94cb2c~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:800:327.webp?dr=12185&amp;t=555f072d&amp;ps=933b5bde&amp;shp=c940a200&amp;shcp=9b759fb9&amp;idc=useast5&amp;from=3376456192" alt="Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set - 4/6 Pc Bedding Set with 16&#x27;&#x27; Deep Pocket Lightweight, Twill, Smooth Fitted Sheets, Cooling Breathable, Hotel Luxury Super Silky Soft, Wrinkle &amp; Fade Resistant" title="Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set - 4/6 Pc Bedding Set with 16&#x27;&#x27; Deep Pocket Lightweight, Twill, Smooth Fitted Sheets, Cooling Breathable, Hotel Luxury Super Silky Soft, Wrinkle &amp; Fade Resistant" loading="lazy" width="800" height="327" style="aspect-ratio:2.4464831804281344;max-width:max(0px, calc(244.6483vh - 391.4373px))"/><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">Easy Care &amp; Durability</span></div><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Durable and machine washable, these sheets are easy to care for. Wash in cold water on a gentle cycle. Dry at low temperatures. Avoid using fabric softeners and bleaches to prevent wrinkles.</span></div><img class="descriptionImage-mNxo82 mb-8 rounded-12" src="https://p16-oec-general-useast8.ttcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2/d7fbb51a20a54cc883e287755970e8a6~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:800:327.webp?dr=12185&amp;t=555f072d&amp;ps=933b5bde&amp;shp=c940a200&amp;shcp=9b759fb9&amp;idc=useast5&amp;from=3376456192" alt="Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set - 4/6 Pc Bedding Set with 16&#x27;&#x27; Deep Pocket Lightweight, Twill, Smooth Fitted Sheets, Cooling Breathable, Hotel Luxury Super Silky Soft, Wrinkle &amp; Fade Resistant" title="Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set - 4/6 Pc Bedding Set with 16&#x27;&#x27; Deep Pocket Lightweight, Twill, Smooth Fitted Sheets, Cooling Breathable, Hotel Luxury Super Silky Soft, Wrinkle &amp; Fade Resistant" loading="lazy" width="800" height="327" style="aspect-ratio:2.4464831804281344;max-width:max(0px, calc(244.6483vh - 391.4373px))"/><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#000000">Product included</span></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Full: 4 pc/6 pc sets include 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet, 2/4 pillowcases.</span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Queen: 4 pc/6 pc sets include 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet, 2/4 pillowcases.</span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">King: 4 pc/6 pc sets include 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet, 2/4 pillowcases.</span></div></div><div class="flex"><span class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal flex-shrink-0 mr-4" style="font-size:16px">·</span><div class="font-sans text-color-UIText1 mb-8 break-words whitespace-normal min-w-0" style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Cal King: 4 pc/6 pc sets include 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet, 2/4 pillowcases.</span></div></div><img class="descriptionImage-mNxo82 mb-8 rounded-12" src="https://p16-oec-general-useast8.ttcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2/868d9f2b9d334d3aae62717ddf6bfe0c~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:800:327.webp?dr=12185&amp;t=555f072d&amp;ps=933b5bde&amp;shp=c940a200&amp;shcp=9b759fb9&amp;idc=useast5&amp;from=3376456192" alt="Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set - 4/6 Pc Bedding Set with 16&#x27;&#x27; Deep Pocket Lightweight, Twill, Smooth Fitted Sheets, Cooling Breathable, Hotel Luxury Super Silky Soft, Wrinkle &amp; Fade Resistant" title="Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set - 4/6 Pc Bedding Set with 16&#x27;&#x27; Deep Pocket Lightweight, Twill, Smooth Fitted Sheets, Cooling Breathable, Hotel Luxury Super Silky Soft, Wrinkle &amp; Fade Resistant" loading="lazy" width="800" height="327" style="aspect-ratio:2.4464831804281344;max-width:max(0px, calc(244.6483vh - 391.4373px))"/></div><div class="cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center w-full mt-20"><span class="Headline-Semibold text-color-UIText1 rounded-8 background-color-UIShapeNeutral4 px-24 py-13">View more</span></div><div class="absolute bottom-60 left-0 right-0 h-60 bg-gradient-to-t from-white to-transparent poin