 0 0 0-1.75-1.91c-.7-.5-1.64-1.04-2.78-1.69L18.87 6.14c-1.12-.65-2.06-1.19-2.83-1.54a4.82 4.82 0 0 0-2.52-.55 4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.16 1.84c-.53.73-.7 1.6-.78 2.45-.08.85-.08 1.93-.08 3.22v24.88c0 1.3 0 2.37.08 3.22.08.86.25 1.73.78 2.45a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.16 1.84c.9.1 1.74-.2 2.52-.55.77-.35 1.7-.89 2.83-1.53l21.68-12.44c1.14-.65 2.08-1.2 2.78-1.69.7-.5 1.38-1.08 1.75-1.9Z"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Introduction</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="text-color-UIText1 break-words leading-relaxed" style="font-size:16px">Shilucheng Bamboo Sheet Set is designed for everyday comfort with a soft, smooth feel and a practical deep-pocket fit. Made from 60% rayon derived from bamboo and 40% polyester fiber, it combines a silky touch with durability and easy care. The twill weave adds to the smooth texture, while the lightweight feel makes it suitable for warm-weather sleeping.

This bedding set is a good choice for hot sleepers and anyone who wants a cooler, more breathable sleep surface. The fitted sheet has strong elasticity and is designed to fit mattresses up to 16 inches thick, helping it stay in place through the night. It is also made to absorb moisture and help regulate heat for a drier sleeping experience.

Available in multiple bedding sizes and color options, the set includes 4-piece and 6-piece versions with flat sheet, fitted sheet, and pillowcases. It is machine washable for simple care and everyday use.</div><div class="flex items-center mt-16 cursor-pointer text-color-UIText3"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="16px"><path d="M24 6a18 18 0 1 0 0 36 18 18 0 0 0 0-36ZM2 24a22 22 0 1 1 44 0 22 22 0 0 1-44 0Zm25-8a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm-4 6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V23a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2Z"></path></svg><span class="P3-Regular ml-4">This information is AI generated</span></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Question and answer</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="flex flex-col gap-16"><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">What materials are used in this sheet set?
A:It is made from 60% rayon derived from bamboo and 40% polyester fiber.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">How deep is the fitted sheet pocket?
A:The fitted sheet is designed to fit mattresses up to 16 inches thick.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">What type of weave does the sheet set use?
A:It uses a twill weave.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">Is this sheet set suitable for warm weather?
A:Yes. The product is described as cooling, breathable, and suitable for summer use.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">What items are included in the set?
A:The 4-piece and 6-piece sets include 1 flat sheet, 1 fitted sheet, and 2 or 4 pillowcases.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div><div class="flex items-start"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="font-semibold text-color-UIText1 mb-4" style="font-size:16px">How should this sheet set be cared for?
A:It is machine washable. The care instructions say to wash in cold water on a gentle cycle and dry at low temperatures.</div><div class="text-color-UIText2 break-words" style="font-size:16px"></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center mt-16 cursor-pointer text-color-UIText3"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="16px"><path d="M24 6a18 18 0 1 0 0 36 18 18 0 0 0 0-36ZM2 24a22 22 0 1 1 44 0 22 22 0 0 1-44 0Zm25-8a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm-4 6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V23a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-2Z"></path></svg><span class="P3-Regular ml-4">This information is AI generated</span></div></div></div><div class="expandableSection-AfpLUG"><div class="sectionHeader-mTOhOt clickable-Q3abyt"><span class="H3-Bold text-color-UIText1Display">Safety &amp; compliance</span><div class="chevronIcon-ckYHO1"><svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 48 48" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" font-size="20px"><path d="m24 19.25 13.67 13.67a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0l1.84-1.84a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41L24.71 13.46a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0L7.1 29.66a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.42l1.83 1.84a1 1 0 0 0 1.41 0L24 19.25Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="sectionContent-GpwgDO px-24"><div class="flex flex-col gap-20"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="text-color-UIText1 Headline-Semibold"><span style="font-weight:600;color:#000000">Seller information</span></div><div class="text-color-UIText1 Headline-Regular flex"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="min-w-0"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Business name: Ruyu Co., Ltd.</span></div></div><div class="text-color-UIText1 Headline-Regular flex"><span class="text-color-UIText1 mx-8 flex-shrink-0" style="font-size:16px">•</span><div class="min-w-0"><span style="font-weight:400;color:#000000">Business address: 1312 17th Street Suite 559,Denver,Colorado,80202</span></div></div></div></div><