rice. ","font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":5}}},"{{VGhpc_1}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":"14\" Deep Pocket with great elasticity, Stretches to Fit Mattresses Up to 16\" Thick.","font":{"font_weight":3,"font_class":5}}},"{{VGhpc_2}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":" The sheets grip and fit better than any other set, ensuring no sliding during sleep. Enjoy a restful night's sleep with these sheets.","font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":5}}}},"text_attribute":{"font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":4},"font_color":{"color":"#FF000000"}}}},{"type":"image","image":{"width":800,"height":327,"uri":"tos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2\u002Ff5727f32345d45a8bd7db4154df565d4","url_list":["https:\u002F\u002Fp16-oec-general-useast8.ttcdn-us.com\u002Ftos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2\u002Ff5727f32345d45a8bd7db4154df565d4~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:800:327.webp?dr=12185&t=555f072d&ps=933b5bde&shp=c940a200&shcp=9b759fb9&idc=useast5&from=3376456192","https:\u002F\u002Fp19-oec-general-useast8.ttcdn-us.com\u002Ftos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2\u002Ff5727f32345d45a8bd7db4154df565d4~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:800:327.webp?dr=12185&t=555f072d&ps=933b5bde&shp=c940a200&shcp=9b759fb9&idc=useast5&from=3376456192"]}},{"type":"text","text":"Shockingly Soft & Silky","rich_text":{"text_alignment":1,"template":"{{U2hvY_0}}","arguments":{"{{U2hvY_0}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":"Shockingly Soft & Silky","font":{"font_weight":3,"font_class":5}}}},"text_attribute":{"font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":4},"font_color":{"color":"#FF000000"}}}},{"type":"text","text":"Made from 60% rayon derived from bamboo and 40% polyester fiber, with a unique twill weave. It's stronger than cotton, smooth like silk, and cool to the touch. Sleep like you're on a cloud. Ideal for hot sleepers, these sheets provide comfort and coolness.","rich_text":{"text_alignment":1,"template":"{{TWFkZ_0}}{{TWFkZ_1}}{{TWFkZ_2}}","arguments":{"{{TWFkZ_0}}":{"text_attribute":{"is_italic":true,"text":"Made from 60% rayon derived from bamboo and 40% polyester fiber","font":{"font_weight":3,"font_class":5}}},"{{TWFkZ_1}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":",","font":{"font_weight":3,"font_class":5}}},"{{TWFkZ_2}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":" with a unique twill weave. It's stronger than cotton, smooth like silk, and cool to the touch. Sleep like you're on a cloud. Ideal for hot sleepers, these sheets provide comfort and coolness.","font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":5}}}},"text_attribute":{"font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":4},"font_color":{"color":"#FF000000"}}}},{"type":"image","image":{"width":800,"height":327,"uri":"tos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2\u002F027b5b2b82d3477f9a7c335c8956f927","url_list":["https:\u002F\u002Fp16-oec-general-useast8.ttcdn-us.com\u002Ftos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2\u002F027b5b2b82d3477f9a7c335c8956f927~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:800:327.webp?dr=12185&t=555f072d&ps=933b5bde&shp=c940a200&shcp=9b759fb9&idc=useast5&from=3376456192","https:\u002F\u002Fp19-oec-general-useast8.ttcdn-us.com\u002Ftos-useast8-i-rt0ujvrtvp-tx2\u002F027b5b2b82d3477f9a7c335c8956f927~tplv-fhlh96nyum-resize-webp:800:327.webp?dr=12185&t=555f072d&ps=933b5bde&shp=c940a200&shcp=9b759fb9&idc=useast5&from=3376456192"]}},{"type":"text","text":"️ Adjust Temperature & Absorb Water ️","rich_text":{"text_alignment":1,"template":"{{77iPI_0}}{{77iPI_1}}{{77iPI_2}}","arguments":{"{{77iPI_2}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":" ️","font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":5}}},"{{77iPI_0}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":"️ ","font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":5}}},"{{77iPI_1}}":{"text_attribute":{"text":"Adjust Temperature & Absorb Water","font":{"font_weight":3,"font_class":5}}}},"text_attribute":{"font":{"font_weight":1,"font_class":4},"font_color":{"color":"#FF000000"}}}},{"type":"text","text":"The sheets adjust temperature and absorb most of the heat, keeping you cool in summer. They also absorb moisture, keeping you dry and eliminating bad sleep experiences for those with night sweats.","rich_text":{"text_alignment":1,"template":"{{VGhlI_0}}","arguments":{"